"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit memuat turun Electron 41.10.7 rasmi (113 MiB pada Apple silicon atau 119 MiB pada Intel; muatan yang diekstrak masing-masing kira-kira 275 MiB dan 303 MiB). ZIP dan boleh laku Electron disahkan menggunakan SHA-256 sebelum digunakan. Biscuit mengekalkan keseluruhan muatan runtime rasmi serta notis LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html dalam folder peribadi. Tiada apa-apa dipasang secara global; profil pelayar peribadi, Codex dan runtime kongsi tidak disentuh. Perlindungan kotak pasir Electron dan OS kekal diaktifkan.";
"Biscuit downloads the configured GitHub release, verifies its SHA-256 digest when published, bundle identity, version, universal architectures, macOS compatibility, and code signature, then keeps your current app as a rollback copy before replacing it. Your data and preferences stay in place. The app folder must be writable; Biscuit never requests administrator access." = "Biscuit memuat turun keluaran GitHub yang dikonfigurasikan, mengesahkan ringkasan SHA-256 jika diterbitkan, identiti himpunan, versi, seni bina universal, keserasian macOS dan tandatangan kod, kemudian menyimpan app semasa anda sebagai salinan untuk pemulihan sebelum menggantikannya. Data dan keutamaan anda kekal. Folder app mesti boleh ditulis; Biscuit tidak pernah meminta akses pentadbir.";
