"The saved todos are unavailable." = "Tugas tersimpan tidak tersedia.";
"The scrolling capture controls could not be safely excluded. Cancel this session; no image was saved." = "Kawalan tangkapan menatal tidak dapat dikecualikan dengan selamat. Batalkan sesi ini; tiada imej disimpan.";
"The selected Codex auth.json does not contain a supported ChatGPT OAuth session." = "auth.json Codex yang dipilih tidak mengandungi sesi OAuth ChatGPT yang disokong.";
"The selected Codex auth.json token was rejected. biscuit will not refresh it; reconnect Codex or select app-server mode." = "Token auth.json Codex yang dipilih ditolak. biscuit tidak akan menyegarkannya; sambungkan semula Codex atau pilih mod pelayan aplikasi.";
"The selected area changed pixel size while scrolling. Cancel and start again without moving the display layout." = "Saiz piksel kawasan pilihan berubah semasa menatal. Batalkan dan mulakan semula tanpa mengubah susun atur paparan.";
