"The update failed and automatic restoration was incomplete. Keep both app copies and contact the Biscuit maintainers." = "Kemas kini gagal dan pemulihan automatik tidak selesai. Simpan kedua-dua salinan app dan hubungi penyelenggara Biscuit.";
